        "message": "Record map->odom TF edge arrivals in the hotel fixture\n\nA read-only /tf subscription now records every map->odom edge (stamp\nplus wall receipt) and odom->base_footprint gaps over 50 ms, written to\ntf-edges.json. The controller's synchronous current-time lookups wait on\ntransform edges, and AMCL publishes map->odom per scan, so correlating\nedge arrivals with any controller block directly confirms or refutes\nthe late-edge mechanism. Passive evidence only: no authority, no\nbehavior change, no threshold change. 170 safety tests pass."
      },
